# a_parallel_map_runs_its_items_at_once

# go_maps_in_parallel
is! 'twice(x) := x * 2; xs = []; for i in 1 to 20 { xs.add(i) }; ys = await go xs.map(twice); [#ys, ys#1, ys#20]' [20, 2, 40]

# go_for_runs_its_iterations_in_parallel
is! 'shared n = 0; started = clock(); go for x in [1,2,3] { sleep(500 ms); n += 1 }; [n, clock() - started < 1200]' [3, 1]

